WEBVTT

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.680
(groaning)

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.360
(Newt grunts)

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.560
(Newt grunts)

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.360
(panting) Accio.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:33.800
(grunts)

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.000
(creature trilling)

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.600
(yelps, gasping)

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.320
(whistles)

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.320
-(Newt grunts) -(screeches)

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:04.760
(grunts)

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.160
(dark music playing)

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.080
(squealing)

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.520
(whimpering)

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.040
(shuddering)

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:29.160
(ominous music playing)

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:36.120
(squeaks)

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.440
(trilling)

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.040
(gasps)

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:02.400
(Qilin breathing laboriously)

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.920
I'm so sorry.

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:18.120
(creature grunts)

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.200
(soft trill)

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:29.840
(grunts)

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.440
(Newt grunts)

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:40.720
-(trilling softly) -(Newt
breathing shakily)

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:43.680
(baby Qilin purring)

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.360
Twins.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:53.280
You had twins.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.520
(Qilin sighs)

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:04.640
(baby Qilin trilling)

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:06.640
(gentle music playing)

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.440
(chatters)

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.200
-(Pick chatters) -(sniffing)

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.680
(gentle music continues)

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.200
(creature 1 growls)

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.400
(creature 2 growls)

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.520
(clicks)

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.520
(playful music playing)

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.400
(clucks)

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.640
(enchanting music playing)

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.720
-(Newt grunts) -(chatters)

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.560
(enchanting music continues)

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.080
(trilling)

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:31.200
(grand orchestral music playing)

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.400
(swift whooshing)

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.040
(whooshing continues)

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.600
(Grindelwald) Leave us.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.280
Show me.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.160
(trilling)

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.320
The others, they said it was
special.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.760
Ooh, it's beyond special.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:34.960
See?

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.240
See its eyes?

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.000
Those eyes see everything.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:44.840
When a Qilin is born,
a righteous leader

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:47.040
will rise to change
our world forever.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:54.280
Her birth brings change,
Credence, to everything.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.560
You did well.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.120
Go.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.360
Rest.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:14.600
(squeaking)

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:23.960
(continues squeaking)

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.840
(suspenseful music plays)

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.400
-(trills weakly) -There.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.240
There.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.440
(wistful music playing)

